  data: {
    LLM: "Void suits early so you can discard hearts or the Queen of Spades when others lead that suit. Pass high cards you don't want.\n\nProtect your high Spades. If you have the Ace or King of Spades, pass them or keep enough low Spades to duck under the Queen. Track which hearts and the Queen have been played.\n\nShooting the Moon requires high cards across multiple suits to maintain lead and capture all point cards. If you see an opponent is collecting all penalty cards, sacrifice a trick to take one heart to block them. Count cards meticulously to know when it's safe to lead high.",
    Player: "Void suits early so you can discard hearts or the Queen of Spades when others lead that suit. Pass high cards you don't want.\n\nProtect your high Spades. If you have the Ace or King of Spades, pass them or keep enough low Spades to duck under the Queen. Track which hearts and the Queen have been played.\n\nShooting the Moon requires high cards across multiple suits to maintain lead and capture all point cards. If you see an opponent is collecting all penalty cards, sacrifice a trick to take one heart to block them. Count cards meticulously to know when it's safe to lead high.",
