    basic: "Void suits early so you can discard hearts or the Queen of Spades when others lead that suit. Pass high cards you don't want.",
    intermediate: 'Protect your high Spades. If you have the Ace or King of Spades, pass them or keep enough low Spades to duck under the Queen. Track which hearts and the Queen have been played.',
